process-media (2.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package for the Python rewrite (2.0.0).
    - Drop the legacy Perl implementation in favour of a Python 3.11+
      package built with hatchling.
    - Drop the ``pyexiftool`` Python dependency in favour of calling the
      ``exiftool`` binary directly, keeping the dependency footprint
      aligned with what Debian stable / Ubuntu LTS ship out of the box.
    - Switch the project license to MIT.

 -- Laurent Lavaud <l.lavaud@gmail.com>  Tue, 19 May 2026 22:36:35 +0200
